Significance: minor
Type: changed

The `read_post` and `edit_post` capability constants move from `Event` to a new `GatherPress\Core\Capability` class. A new `Has_Capabilities` trait gives `Event` and `Venue` `read_capability()` and `edit_capability()` methods that default to those constants, so either class can use its own capability later without changing the shared default. `Event::READ_CAPABILITY` and `Event::EDIT_CAPABILITY` are removed, so code using them should switch to `Event::read_capability()` and `Event::edit_capability()`.
